        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Mookychick, BUST\n- Topics: feminist media, online communities, sociopolitical analysis, culture, alternative fashion\n\nFacts:\n- Mookychick is an independent daily online magazine and community.\n- Mookychick has more than 100,000 readers per month and more than 5,000 forum members.\n- Mookychick publishes content on current sociopolitical events, social and cultural trends, alternative fashion, movies, books, music, and arts and crafts from a feminist perspective.\n- BUST is a feminist women's lifestyle magazine that is published six times a year.\n- The chunk contrasts Mookychick with BUST.\n- BUST is published by Adrienne Rich and Laurie Henzel.",
